---
permalink: /jobs-workshop-2026.ics
layout: null
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Commas and semicolons are field separators in iCalendar TEXT values and must be
backslash-escaped, or clients truncate the value at the first one. Lines are
kept short because long lines are supposed to be folded, which Liquid cannot
do cleanly.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign w = site.data.workshop -%}
{%- assign summary = w.full_name | replace: ",", "\," | replace: ";", "\;" -%}
{%- assign place = w.venue_name | append: ", " | append: w.city | replace: ",", "\," -%}
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//CASA//JOBS Workshop//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:{{ w.calendar.uid }}
DTSTAMP:{{ w.calendar.start_utc }}
DTSTART:{{ w.calendar.start_utc }}
DTEND:{{ w.calendar.end_utc }}
SUMMARY:{{ summary }} ({{ w.edition }})
LOCATION:{{ place }}
DESCRIPTION:Job search workshop for PhD students and postdocs.
URL:{{ '/' | absolute_url }}
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
